.SH NAME
blast-inspect - Analyze the blast radius of a file


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBblast inspect  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Analyze a file's direct and indirect dependents within the JS/TS module
graph, plus Git history, relevant CI workflows, and an explainable risk
score. See "blast --help" for the v0.1 module-resolution scope and
limitations.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--fail-on\fP=""
	exit with code 2 if risk is at or above this level (low, medium, high)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for inspect

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	output machine-readable JSON


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBblast(1)\fP


